# Local configuration.
#
# It holds the power strips' passwords, encrypted by DPAPI with the key of
# the machine's Windows account -- unreadable elsewhere, so useless to
# whoever got hold of them, but also useless to whoever clones the repo.
# Above all it holds the devices' MAC addresses, their IP addresses and the
# hardware identifier of each screen: the inventory of a private network.
config.json
config.json.*

# Runtime log.
#
# It records local network addresses and mDNS names, which contain the MAC
# addresses. It grows with every session and tells nothing to anyone but
# the person troubleshooting their own installation.
shelly-screens.log
shelly-screens.log.*

# Power consumption history.
#
# Measurements specific to this installation, which grow every day and
# tell nothing to whoever clones the repo.
history/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# Virtual environments
.venv/
.venv-build/
venv/
env/

# Packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.spec

# Editors and file system
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini



